ge, RSS/PSS memory, swap, page faults, disk I/O, thread count and open file descriptors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, allowing system-level changes to be correlated with individual RDK components.&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
